  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Result_d51722.html\">ara::core::Result</a>&lt; void &gt; ConfigureMonitor (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_diag_ara_diag_fbd60d.html#SWS_DM_01701\">MonitorHandleType</a> monitor Handle, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_diag_ara_diag_fbd60d.html#SWS_DM_02121\">InitMonitorNotifier</a> initMonitor, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_diag_TimeBased_573f80.html\">TimeBased</a> defaultValues) noexcept;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Configures a monitor with time-based debouncing. Any overloaded ConfigureMonitor shall be only called once per monitor. The monitor can only be used after this initialisation step.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
